Should Have Power On All RFs
    [Arguments]     ${vcu_quantity}=${EMPTY}
    [Documentation]   Check there is power on all RFs (include TDD and FDD).
    ...    author: lingting.sun@nokia-sbell.com
    ...    | Input Parameters | Man. | Description |
