Should Have Power On RUs Under Specified vCU
   [Arguments]   ${gnb_index}=0   ${mixed_AP_RU}=${False}    ${is_dc}=${0}    ${serviceuser_new_pwd}=${None}
   [Documentation]   Check there is power on all RUs (include TDD and FDD) under to a specified vCU.
    ...    author: lingting.sun@nokia-sbell.com
    ...    | Input Parameters | Man. | Description |
    ...    | gnb_index  | yes  |  gnb index, default is 0  |
    ...
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...    None
    ...
    ...    Example
    ...    |  Should Have Power On RUs Under Specified vCU  |
    ${quantity_of_vdu_for_specified_vcu}=   tl_config.get_vdu_number   gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    log to console   ${quantity_of_vdu_for_specified_vcu}
    FOR   ${vdu_index}   IN RANGE   ${quantity_of_vdu_for_specified_vcu}
        ${TDD_RUs}  ${FDD_RUs}    Get TDD/FDD RU Info On Specific vCU And VDU
        ...  gnb_index=${gnb_index}   vdu_index=${vdu_index}    mixed_AP_RU=${mixed_AP_RU}  serviceuser_new_pwd=${serviceuser_new_pwd}
        ${TDD_length}=   get length    ${TDD_RUs}
        ${FDD_length}=   get length    ${FDD_RUs}
        ${RF_length} =   evaluate   ${TDD_length}+${FDD_length}
        Run Keyword And Continue On Failure  Should Not Be Equal    ${RF_length}   ${0}    msg=please check the rf on webui
        run keyword if   ${TDD_length} > 0   _Should Have Power On TDD RUs Under Specified vCU And VDU   TDD_RUs=${TDD_RUs}
        ...   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   gnb_index=${gnb_index}   is_dc=${is_dc}
        run keyword if   ${FDD_length} > 0 and ${is_dc} == ${0}   _Should Have Power On FDD RUs Under Specified vCU And VDU
        ...    FDD_RUs=${FDD_RUs}    gnb_index=${gnb_index}   vdu_index=${vdu_index}
        run keyword if   ${FDD_length} > 0 and ${is_dc} == ${1}   _Should Have Power On DC FDD RUs Under Specified vCU And VDU
        ...    FDD_RUs=${FDD_RUs}    vdu_index=${vdu_index}   gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    END


