Get RU Info List From Testline
    [Arguments]    ${gnb_index}=0   ${vdu_index}=0   ${mixed_AP_RU}=${False}  ${serviceuser_new_pwd}=${None}
   [Documentation]   get the rf info list including model, type, username, password, atten_list, 2nduser. etc
    ...    author: lingting.sun@nokia-sbell.com
    ...    modified by:  lingting.sun@nokia-sbell.com  <02-03-2022>, <lingtsun>, <Add RF_local_ip>
    ...    | Input Parameters | Man. | Description |
    ...    | gnb_index  | yes  |  gnb index, default is 0  |
    ...    | vdu_index  | yes  |  gnb index, default is 0  |
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...    rf_info_list
    ...
    ...    Example
    ...    |  Get RU Info List From Testline |
    ${ru_model_list}=  create list
    ${conn_alias}    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    vdu_gen.login_rest   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   gnb_index=${gnb_index}   alias=${conn_alias}
    ${rmods_info}  vdu_ope_base.get_rmod_status  conn_alias=${conn_alias}
    ${real_rmods_info}  Run Keyword If  "${mixed_AP_RU}"=="${True}"  ru_generic.remove_ap_rus
    ...  ru_infos=${rmods_info}  gnb_index=${gnb_index}  vdu_index=${vdu_index}
    ...  ELSE  set variable  ${rmods_info}
    ${rf_info_list}=   ru_generic.get_ru_infos   ${real_rmods_info}   ${serviceuser_new_pwd}
    run keyword and continue on failure   should not be empty  ${rf_info_list}   msg=Please check the rmod status on web
    [return]   ${rf_info_list}
    [Teardown]    vdu_gen.logout_rest    conn_alias=${conn_alias}


