    ...    | gnb_index  | yes  |  gnb index, default is 0  |
    ...    | vdu_index  | yes  |  gnb index, default is 0  |
    ...
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...    None
    ...
    ...    Example
    ...    |  _Should Have Power On TDD RUs Under Specified vCU And VDU |
    ${length}   get length   ${TDD_RUs}
    FOR    ${index}    IN RANGE   0    ${length}
        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds   3x   10   _RF Check Power Of One TDD   ${TDD_RUS}    gnb_index=${gnb_index}
        ...  vdu_index=${vdu_index}   index=${index}    is_dc=${is_dc}
    END

