    ...    |  _Should Have Power On FDD RUs Under Specified vCU And VDU  |
    log to console    This is RFRL check power interface on SWN FDD.
    ${quantity_of_fhgw_for_specified_vdu}   tl_config.get_fhgw_number   gnb_index=${gnb_index}   vdu_index=${vdu_index}
    FOR   ${fhgw_index}   IN RANGE   ${quantity_of_fhgw_for_specified_vdu}
