_Should Have Power On FDD RUs Under Specified vCU And VDU And FHGW
   [Arguments]    ${FDD_RUs}   ${gnb_index}=0   ${vdu_index}=0   ${fhgw_index}=0
   [Documentation]   Check there is power on all FDD RUs Under to a specified vCU/vDU/FHGW.
    ...    author: fen.huang@nokia-sbell.com
    ...    | Input Parameters | Man. | Description |
    ...    |  FDD_RUs     | no |  the info list of all FDD rus  |
    ...    | gnb_index    | yes  |  gnb index, default is 0  |
    ...    | vdu_index    | yes  |  gnb index, default is 0  |
    ...    |  fhgw_index  | yes  |  gnb index, default is 0  |
    ...
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...    None
    ...
    ...    Example
    ...    |  Should Have Power On RUs Under Specified vCU And VDU And FHGW  |

    ${FDD_RUs}=   ru_fdd_ope.get_ru_ip   ru_infos=${FDD_RUs}  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ...   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   fhgw_index=${fhgw_index}
    ${length}   get length   ${FDD_RUs}
    ${conn_alias}    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    vdu_gen.login_rest   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   gnb_index=${gnb_index}   alias=${conn_alias}
    ${cell_status}   vdu_ope_base.get_all_vdu_cells_statuses   conn_alias=${conn_alias}
    ${cell_band_dict}    ru_generic.get_cell_band_mapping  cell_status=${cell_status}  cell_technology=FDD
    ${cell_list}   Get Dictionary Keys   ${cell_band_dict}
    FOR    ${index}    IN RANGE   0    ${length}
        ${ru_index}   evaluate  ${index}+1
        ${band}   Get From Dictionary    ${cell_band_dict}   ${cell_list}[${index}]
        ${atten_list}   set variable   ${FDD_RUs}[${index}][atten][${band}]
        _RF Check Power FDD   FDD_RU=${FDD_RUs[${index}]}  gnb_index=${gnb_index}   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   fhgw_index=${fhgw_index}
        ...   ru_index=${ru_index}   atten_list=${atten_list}
    END
    [Teardown]  vdu_gen.logout_rest    conn_alias=${conn_alias}


