    ...    |  fhgw_index  | yes  |  gnb index, default is 0  |
    ...
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...    None
    ...
    ...    Example
    ...    |  _Collect Logs On FDD RUs Under Specified vCU And VDU And FHGW |

    ${FDD_RUs}=   ru_fdd_ope.get_ru_ip   ru_infos=${FDD_RUs}  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ...   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   fhgw_index=${fhgw_index}
    ${length}   get length   ${FDD_RUs}
    FOR    ${index}    IN RANGE   0    ${length}
        Collec Logs On Specfic FDD RU   FDD_RU=${FDD_RUs[${index}]}   gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ...   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   fhgw_index=${fhgw_index}  local_dir=${local_dir}
    END


